      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norma%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In September 1926 Norma was wired for electricity, and by 1928 it became the first town in Pittsgrove Township to light its streets.",
